answers often include some descriptive words,

65
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:46,040
such as words showing parts or components of the diagram,

66
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:56,200
prepositions of position, such as below, through, between,
etc., sequence words, such as then, after, finally, etc.

